  "how_to_tell_apart": "Written Bokmål sits between Danish and Nynorsk. Keep av, noe, dere, meg/deg, hei and takk as the positive cues, and treat jeg/ikke/et as necessary but insufficient because Danish uses them too. If the same speaker produces eg, ikkje, eit, kva, noko or korleis, switch the label to Nynorsk. Swedish shows up instead as jag/är/inte/och plus ä/ö. The frequency list used here is the OpenSubtitles file named no, which in practice is Bokmål-heavy.",
